      "content": "The \"Quiet Luxury\" aesthetic is clearly the most sophisticated, appealing to the established elite who value subtle wealth. High-concept indie folk speaks to a certain educated, artistic class, while Reggaeton trends are more mainstream and accessible. Drill music and AAVE-derived slang are inherently tied to specific urban demographics and are generally considered less \"prestigious\" for high-end brands.",
